Summary of important user-visible changes for drafting 0.1.0:
-------------------------------------------------------------------

 ** Initial development version.  Nothing released yet.

 ** `+geom` -- signed area, bounding box, centroid, affine transform,
    rectilinear test, rectilinear polygon offset, and largest inscribed
    rectangle.

 ** `+dxf` -- AutoCAD R12 (AC1009) ASCII DXF read and write, covering LINE,
    POLYLINE, LWPOLYLINE, CIRCLE, ARC, TEXT and POINT.  R12 has no LWPOLYLINE,
    so an entity of that type is written as a POLYLINE with its geometry, layer
    and closed flag preserved.

 ** `+draw` -- `draw.Drawing`, a value class carrying line, polyline, arc,
    circle, text, hatch and dimension entities on named layers; `draw.entities`
    converts it for `dxf.write`, and `draw.tikz` emits LaTeX for reports.
